> Has the <strong>UPSC Engineering Services Mains Result 2026</strong> been announced?</span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> Yes, the <strong data-end=\"275\" data-start=\"221\">UPSC Engineering Services (ESE) Mains Result 2026</strong> has been officially announced by the <strong data-end=\"355\" data-start=\"313\">Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> When will the <strong>UPSC ESE mains Exam 2026 be conducted?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The <strong data-end=\"474\" data-start=\"433\">UPSC ESE Preliminary Examination 2025</strong> will be conducted on <strong data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"496\">21 June 2026</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Which organization conducts the <strong>ESE Exam 2026?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The <strong data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"598\">Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong> conducts the <strong data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"654\">Engineering Services Examination</strong> every year.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the purpose of the <strong>UPSC ESE Mains Exam 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer: </strong></strong></strong>The Mains Exam serves as the first stage to shortlist candidates for the Mains Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 89px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>UPSC </b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <b>UPSC </b>is <strong>http://www.upsc.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"UPSC Engineering Services Mains Result 2026\" class=\"size-large wp-image-38897 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-25T104432.530-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-25T104432.530-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-25T104432.530-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-25T104432.530-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-07-25T104432.530.jpg 1200w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</